            "default_open": true,
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/ufvut.webp",
            "heading": "Delivered Below the Surface",
            "text": "<p>Creams and hydrogel patches sit on top of the skin, where the barrier stops most of what’s in them. Cebeam’s dissolving micro-cones start below that barrier, so the actives reach where the shadow and puffiness actually begin.*</p>",
            "bullets": "Beneath the skin barrier, not on top\nPainless dissolving micro-cones\nNo needles, no procedure\nNo downtime",
            "footnote": "This is why the difference builds instead of washing off.*"
          }
        },
        "tab2": {
          "type": "tab_item",
          "settings": {
            "tab_label": "What’s Inside",
            "default_open": false,
            "heading": "A Formula Made for Eyes",
            "text": "<p>Hyaluronic acid, niacinamide, peptides &amp; collagen, vitamin C and retinol — chosen for the thin under-eye area and free from fragrance and harsh fillers. The cones are made from the actives themselves, not a soaked serum.</p>",
            "bullets": "Hyaluronic acid for hydration & plumping\nNiacinamide to brighten tone\nPeptides & retinol to smooth lines",
